  <FLAVOURTEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="en-US"><![CDATA[Stand your post for duty. Stand your ground for honor.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="fr-FR"><![CDATA[Défendez votre poste par devoir. Défendez votre position pour l'honneur.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="es-ES"><![CDATA[Mantente en tu puesto por deber. Mantente firme por honor.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="de-DE"><![CDATA[Auf dem Posten zu bleiben, ist Pflichterfüllung. Seine Stellung zu behaupten, ist Ehrensache.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="it-IT"><![CDATA[Resisti alla stanchezza per senso del dovere. Resisti al nemico per senso dell’onore.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="jp-JA"><![CDATA[任務のために持ち場につけ。名誉のために持ちこたえろ。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ko-KR"><![CDATA[각자의 근무 지역을 떠나지 마라. 명예를 가지고 지켜라.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="ru-RU"><![CDATA[Стой на своем посту во имя долга. Оставайся незыблем во имя чести.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="pt-BR"><![CDATA[Mantenha-se no posto por dever. Matenha-se firme pela honra.]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-CN"><![CDATA[因职责而守卫。为荣誉而守护。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
    <LOCALISED_TEXT LanguageCode="zh-HK"><![CDATA[因職責而守衛。為榮譽而守護。]]></LOCALISED_TEXT>
  </FLAVOURTEXT>
